guide forever/horde/40-50/02-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows
faction Horde
levels 41-43
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas
# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visit 31 part 2/2 (Stranglethorn Vale, levels 41.3-42.3) and visit 32
# (Swamp of Sorrows, 42.3-42.5). Checked by lint, not play-tested on Forever
# yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Booty Bay (where the previous guide ends) -> the ghost pirates ->
# Zul'Mamwe and the Balia'mah and Ziata'jai trophy skulls ->
# Grom'gol -> hearth to Booty Bay -> fly Grom'gol -> Nesingwary -> north
# through Duskwood and Deadwind Pass -> Stonard (flight path) -> Galen's
# escort, Noboru and Galen's strongbox -> crocolisks -> the Harborage ->
# Misty Reed Post -> the snappers on the strand -> Misty Reed Post.
#
# Deviations from the simulator's order:
# - One stay at Zul'Mamwe for Speaking with Gan'zulah (586), Split Bone
#   Necklace (598), Skullsplitter Tusks (209, from the previous guide) and
#   Speaking with Nezzliok (585, export visit 38 at level 44: its trophy
#   skulls stand at Zul'Mamwe, Ziata'jai and Balia'mah on the same loop).
# - Hearthstone: the simulator rebinds at Grom'gol, hearths there from
#   Nesingwary and flies to Booty Bay for Voodoo Dues. Here the Booty Bay
#   bind from the previous guide carries you from Grom'gol to Booty Bay, and
#   one flight back to Grom'gol puts Nesingwary on the road north. The
#   Stonard bind is dropped: the route never hearths to it before the next
#   bind.
# - Swamp of Sorrows: the Harborage (Noboru the Cudgel) after the
#   crocolisks, so the west of the swamp is visited once before riding to
#   Misty Reed Post.
#
# Turned in here from earlier guides: Report to Helgrum (1420, from the
# Badlands).
#
# Left out: nothing from the export's share of these visits.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Voodoo Dues and Zul'Mamwe

step Pirate ghosts
  tip The three ghostly pirates haunt the jungle north of Booty Bay, near Zanzil's camps: Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east.
  kill 2535 @35.3,51.3
  collect 3924 quest 609.1
  kill 2536 @34.9,51.8
  collect 3925 quest 609.2
  kill 2537 @40.0,58.2
  collect 3926 quest 609.3

step Zul'Mamwe
  tip Ride north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all.
  goto 46.7,43.9 "Zul'Mamwe"
  kill 669 quest 586.1
  kill 781 quest 586.2
  kill 783 quest 586.3
  collect 3909 quest 586.4 @44.3,45.0
  collect 3908 quest 585.3
  goto 45.4,36.2 "Skullsplitter warriors"
  collect 1524 quest 209.1
  collect 3916 quest 598.1

step Balia'mah Ruins
  tip The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp.
  collect 3906 quest 585.1

step Ziata'jai Ruins
  tip The last skulls are in the ruins a short ride west, on the way back to Grom'gol.
  collect 3907 quest 585.2

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  tip Ride west to Grom'gol.
  turnin 573                            -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  turnin 586                            -- the Bubbling Cauldron
  turnin 585
  turnin 598                            -- Kin'weelay

step Hearth to Booty Bay
  hearth "Booty Bay"
  turnin 609                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  turnin 209                            -- Kebok

step Fly to Grom'gol
  fly "Grom'gol"

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Ride north up the road to the hunters' camp.
  turnin 196                            -- Hemet Nesingwary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Into the Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Keep riding north into Duskwood, then east along the road through Deadwind Pass. Stonard lies in the reeds south of the road.
  goto 46.0,54.7 "Stonard"

step Stonard
  getfp "Stonard" npc 6026              -- Breyk
  turnin 1420                           -- Helgrum the Swift
  accept 698                            -- Dar

step Galen's Escape
  tip Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393

step Noboru the Cudgel
  tip Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest.
  kill 5477 @54.9,34.1
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Galen's Strongbox
  tip His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard.
  turnin 1393

step Sawtooth crocolisks
  tip The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank.
  goto 53.2,41.1 "Crocolisk pools"
  goto 55.4,49.3 "Southern pools"
  collect 6169 quest 698.1

step The Harborage
  tip Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  turnin 1392                           -- Magtoor

step Misty Reed Post
  tip Ride back east past Stonard and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore.
  turnin 698                            -- Tok'Kar
  accept 699

step Sawtooth snappers
  tip The snappers line the strand south of the post.
  goto 79.0,98.2 "Southern strand"
  collect 6168 quest 699.1

step Misty Reed Post
  tip The next guide starts here and takes you to Tanaris.
  turnin 699                            -- Tok'Kar
